# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PERFORMANCE GENOME — H-PERF series
# Pilot directive: the aircraft must continuously strive to become
#   (a) More efficient — less energy per kilometre and per hover-second
#   (b) Physically faster — higher achievable top speed
#   (c) More precise — smaller deviation from commanded state
#   (d) Better at reading intent — shorter time from stick to response
#
# These four objectives run continuously, not only during discrete
# hypothesis evaluations. The _MW_PERFORMANCE genome axis accumulates
# weight from whichever mechanisms are producing the best outcomes
# across all flight phases simultaneously.
#
# The continuous performance scorer runs at 1 Hz inside position_hold_tick.
# It maintains running averages of all four metrics and updates the
# _MW_PERFORMANCE axis weights directly — the genome shifts toward
# configurations that are simultaneously faster, more efficient,
# more precise, and more responsive.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

